      "summary": {
        "zh-HK": "從衙門、南門遺址和園林小徑回看九龍寨城的歷史。",
        "en": "Trace the history of Kowloon Walled City through the Yamen, South Gate remnants and garden paths."
      },
      "highlights": [
        {
          "zh-HK": "衙門是保留下來的寨城建築，位於公園中心一帶。",
