      "transport": {
        "zh-HK": "參照康文署「如何前往」的巴士及專線小巴資料，到九龍城東正道一帶再按園圖選入口。",
        "en": "Use LCSD’s bus or green-minibus guidance for Tung Tsing Road in Kowloon City, then follow the park map to a suitable gate.",
        "sourceIds": [
